# B8 "Meet Vivec": named Hortator by the three Houses and Nerevarine by the
# four tribes, the player answers Archcanon Saryoni's sealed note. Danso
# Indules at the High Fane confirms both trials and sends the player in;
# Saryoni hands over the keys to Vivec's palace; Vivec gives Wraithguard and
# takes the player's oath. PositionCell stands in for the walks; ref FormIDs
# carry Morrowind.esm's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from b8_danso
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Danso confirms the Hortator and Nerevarine trials, then sends the player
# to the archcanon.
case b8_danso
run
player->Position 32874 -99585 1091 0
until 300 "danso indules"->GetDistance player < 400
talk danso indules
ask meet the archcanon
expect GetJournalIndex B8_All_Hortator == 50
expect GetJournalIndex B8_All_Nerevarine == 50
expect GetJournalIndex B8_MeetVivec == 5
bye
end

# Saryoni proposes a private meeting with Vivec and gives the keys.
case b8_saryoni
run
player->PositionCell -1097 503 -621 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 GetPCCell "Vivec, High Fane" == 1
talk tholer saryoni
ask Temple's doctrine
choose 3
choose 4
expect GetJournalIndex B8_MeetVivec == 30
expect player->GetItemCount key_Archcanon_private == 1
bye
end

# Vivec gives Wraithguard and takes the oath.
case b8_vivec
run
player->PositionCell 0 -286 -391 0 "Vivec, Palace of Vivec"
until 600 GetPCCell "Vivec, Palace of Vivec" == 1
talk vivec_god
ask business
choose 1
choose 2
choose 5
choose 8
expect GetJournalIndex B8_MeetVivec == 50
expect player->GetItemCount Wraithguard == 1
bye
end
